Author: anthnel <anthoni.devops@proton.me>
Date:   Mon Nov 23 23:41:16 2026 +0100

    feat(security): group the Misconfigurations list by fix with g (DEVDESK-754)

    g now groups the Misconfigurations tab as well as the CVE tab: one row per
    file, rule and state of the built-in fix, with a plain count of findings and
    the Fix in the closed vocabulary. Enter opens the group's findings, and ctrl+o
    from a detail opened in a group is the flat path's, the group being read again
    from the verification re-scan. The grouped list is a table per tab, rebuilt on
    a tab switch or a new result; canFixMisconfig refuses in the grouped list.
    A declined built-in fix never renders a dangling colon.

    Entire-Checkpoint: 12e6cc4d9fbe

